<title>UK: FII sales slightly ahead of last year.</title>
<headline>FII sales slightly ahead of last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British footwear company FII Group Plc said on Thursday sales in the year starting June 1 were slightly up on the previous year.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite sluggish footware markets, I am pleased to say that to date our sales are slightly ahead of last year,&quot; Philip Buscombe, executive chairman of FII, told the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>He said that profit and gross margin improvement initiatives were on track and that the company's simplified organisation structure was working well.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
